"summary, without a bot in the call. KLAP cannot start it or see it. KLAP "
"only receives the summary, when you give it."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://anarlog.so/download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Anarlog</a> ist freie Software, die du auf deinem Computer "
